  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "設計表現法",
    "sub_ename": "DESIGN RENDERING AND PRESENTATION",
    "describe_ch": "設計師是努力學習及嚴格訓練的專業人士。必須熟知業主的需求及其生活方式。藉由徒手畫的設計表現法訓練以及圖面的展現，表達設計想法。再者，回應業主並溝通其設計思維、構想及意念。在本課程中，希望能教導相關基本圖面表現技法，以協助設計者表達意念，進而落實設計構想。",
    "describe_eh": "Designers are professionals who have studied and trained hard. They must become well acquainted with their client so that they can know client's need and style of living. By means of free-hand drawing training, and graphic presentation, designers can express their idea. Moreover, communicate their own thought, concept and ideas back to their client.In this lesson, we hope to teach basic skills and graphic tricks related to help designers expressing ideas and make all the designing concept come true.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
